<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month T-bill yield rises to 22.27 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month T-bill yield rises to 22.27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.27 percent, up from 22.23 percent at an auction one week ago, Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	2,243.73 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.27 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.3203 pct</p>
</text>
